e County emergency operations center Booch DeMARCHI&#134;- assesses the impact.] \n (Studio: Terry Moran)  Report introduced. \n (Charlotte Harbor: Erin Hayes)  The impact of the devastation from the storm on the retirees of Charlotte County reviewed; scenes shown of downed trees & buildings.  [Residents Don & Connie DUNSWORTH, two WOMEN&nbsp- lament their losses.] \n (Studio: Terry Moran)  The routes of Tropical Storm Earl & Hurricane Danielle noted; weather map shown.", "segment_duration": 440, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "60.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762373, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "7xDQ99H2hj", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-15", "broadcast_start_time": "0.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762372, "segment_id": "oXK82sE1Go", "segment_broadcast_id": "7xDQ99H2hj", "segment_title": "Iraq / Conference / Al-Sadr Revolt", "segment_description": "(Studio: Terry Moran)  Report introduced.   (Baghdad: Mike von Fremd)  The extraordinary conference in Iraq while problems go on in Najaf, where the fighting against Shiite cleric Muqtada al-Sadr's militia resumed, featured; scenes shown of nearby insurgent attacks in Baghdad & from Najaf.", "segment_duration": 110, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "500.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762374, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "7xDQ99H2hj", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-15", "broadcast_start_time": "0.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "Wor